ondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\"><img alt=\"Red Piece of Cloth\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Piece_of_Cloth_6c4007.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mammoth Fur Cape\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mammoth_Fur_Cape_e8637b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Diamond Sceptre\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Diamond_Sceptre_809156.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Glacier Shoes\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glacier_Shoes_70740d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shard\"><img alt=\"Shard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shard_ad76d1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Map barbariansettlements Krimhorn\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"125\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Map_barbariansettlements_Krimhorn_d63c6c.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.00<br/>June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>One of the savage Norsir <a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarians\">barbarians</a> camps, and the widest for that matter. The camp is located in the \"Raider Camp\" to the west side. You can access the place via the mountain to the east with lots of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mammoth\">mammoths</a> on, or by foot through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Glacier\">Formorgar Glacier</a>. This place has the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Witch\">Ice Witch</a> Tower where higher level players can hunt. It is a very good place for paladins to level after 35+, and any knights can easily hunt on the Ice Witch tower on higher levels.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Krimhorn NPCs